The world of [[Tibia]] is home to many [[races]] and [[creatures]]. Several of them evolved so high that they communicate in their very own language. We can find such languages as:

* [[Tibia Language|Human Language]], commonly used by [[Players]];
* [[Bonelord Language]], also known as 469, used by the [[Bonelords|Bonelord's race]];
* [[Deepling Language]], used by [[Deeplings]];
* [[Elven Language]], used by the [[Elves|Elvenkind]];
* [[Orc Language]], used by the [[Orcs|Orckind]];
* [[Chakoya Language]], used by [[Chakoyas|Chakoya tribes]];
* [[Gharonk|Gharonk Language]], used by the inhabitants of a city underneath the [[Jakundaf Desert]];
* [[Caveman Language]], used by the [[Zao Mountain NPCs|cavemen]] residing on the [[Zao Mountain]].

